  "description": "The Windows half of a desk-companion app's shell, over Laching.Companion.Shell and Laching.Windows, for WinUI 3: the app's Application and its launch, the speaker (recorded clips and the system speech synthesizer), the chime, the tray status item with its glyph and panel, the window manager, the notifier, the character on the desktop, and the controls every companion draws the same (the character canvas, the speech bubble, the status pill, the window chrome, the Settings rows, the Support window), plus the screenshot run. Code only: no XAML, no strings, no permission prompts.",
